# Local development only. Copy to .env.local if needed.
# The Vite app needs no keys: prices and orders go through the /api routes.

# Set these in Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables.
# They are read on the server only. Do not add a VITE_ prefix.
#   METALS_API_KEY            key from your metals provider
#   METALS_API_PROVIDER       metalpriceapi | metals-api | goldapi
#   SUPABASE_URL              https://<project>.supabase.co
#   SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY service role key (server only)
#   STAFF_PIN                 PIN the counter staff type to open orders
#   RATE_TTL_HOURS            optional, default 24
